{"schema_version":"prompt-runtime.program-scenario.v1","story_path":"user_stories/markdown-code-dependencies.md","criteria":[{"id":"AC1","text":"Indented code after a blank line contributes no destinations, including four-space, tab and quote/list examples; following prose and indented paragraph continuations remain active, with offsets and line endings preserved."},{"id":"AC2","text":"An escaped opening bracket creates neither a link nor an image; escaping only the image marker leaves an ordinary link and no image. Odd and even backslash runs apply to inline and reference uses."},{"id":"AC3","text":"Real destinations retain their spelling, duplicates and order, including angle destinations, balanced parentheses and escaped destination punctuation; reference labels normalize as before and the first definition wins."},{"id":"AC4","text":"Existing code spans, backtick/tilde fences and HTML comments still exclude their example links and definitions while preserving prose offsets and line endings."}],"initial_world":{},"simulation":{},"context":[],
"steps":[
  {"step_id":"author-indented-code","entry_path":"prompts/cli/runtime-markdown.prompt.md","operation":"markdownSectionText","input":{"text":"# Example\n\n    ![a](miss5.svg)\n"},"checks":[{"criterion_id":"AC1","target":"result","path":"/text","op":"equals","value":"# Example\n\n                   \n"}]},
  {"step_id":"author-indented-images","entry_path":"prompts/cli/runtime-markdown.prompt.md","operation":"markdownLinks","input":{"text":{"$step_result":{"step_id":"author-indented-code","path":"/text"}},"definitions":[],"imagesOnly":true},"checks":[{"criterion_id":"AC1","target":"result","path":"/destinations","op":"equals","value":[]}]},
  {"step_id":"author-escaped-image","entry_path":"prompts/cli/runtime-markdown.prompt.md","operation":"markdownLinks","input":{"text":"# Example\n\n\\![a](x)\n","definitions":[],"imagesOnly":true},"checks":[{"criterion_id":"AC2","target":"result","path":"/destinations","op":"equals","value":[]}]},
  {"step_id":"author-remaining-ordinary-link","entry_path":"prompts/cli/runtime-markdown.prompt.md","operation":"markdownLinks","input":{"text":"# Example\n\n\\![a](x)\n","definitions":[]},"checks":[{"criterion_id":"AC2","target":"result","path":"/destinations","op":"equals","value":["x"]}]},
  {"step_id":"author-escaped-bracket","entry_path":"prompts/cli/runtime-markdown.prompt.md","operation":"markdownLinks","input":{"text":"# Example\n\n## Dependencies\n\n!\\[a](x)\n","definitions":[]},"checks":[{"criterion_id":"AC2","target":"result","path":"/destinations","op":"equals","value":[]}]},
  {"step_id":"indentation-boundaries","entry_path":"prompts/cli/runtime-markdown.prompt.md","operation":"markdownSectionText","input":{"text":"# Indentation\r\n\r\n    ![four](missing-four.svg)\r\n\t![tab](missing-tab.svg)\r\n \t![mixed](missing-mixed.svg)\r\n    [chosen]: missing-ref.svg\r\n\r\n![after](after.svg)\r\nParagraph\r\n    ![continuation](paragraph.svg)\r\n\r\n> Quote\r\n>\r\n>     ![quote](missing-quote.svg)\r\n> ![quote-prose](quote.svg)\r\n\r\n- Item\r\n\r\n      ![list](missing-list.svg)\r\n  ![list-prose](list.svg)\r\n\r\n[chosen]: <real.svg>\r\n[ CHOSEN ]: later.svg\r\n![ref][chosen]\r\n[ordinary](context.md)\r\n"},"checks":[{"criterion_id":"AC1","target":"result","path":"/text","op":"equals","value":"# Indentation\r\n\r\n                             \r\n                        \r\n                             \r\n                             \r\n\r\n![after](after.svg)\r\nParagraph\r\n    ![continuation](paragraph.svg)\r\n\r\n> Quote\r\n>\r\n                                 \r\n> ![quote-prose](quote.svg)\r\n\r\n- Item\r\n\r\n                               \r\n  ![list-prose](list.svg)\r\n\r\n[chosen]: <real.svg>\r\n[ CHOSEN ]: later.svg\r\n![ref][chosen]\r\n[ordinary](context.md)\r\n"}]},
  {"step_id":"indentation-definitions","entry_path":"prompts/cli/runtime-markdown.prompt.md","operation":"markdownDefinitions","input":{"text":{"$step_result":{"step_id":"indentation-boundaries","path":"/text"}}},"checks":[{"criterion_id":"AC3","target":"result","path":"/definitions","op":"equals","value":[{"label":"chosen","destination":"real.svg"}]}]},
  {"step_id":"indentation-real-links","entry_path":"prompts/cli/runtime-markdown.prompt.md","operation":"markdownLinks","input":{"text":{"$step_result":{"step_id":"indentation-boundaries","path":"/text"}},"definitions":{"$step_result":{"step_id":"indentation-definitions","path":"/definitions"}}},"checks":[{"criterion_id":"AC1","target":"result","path":"/destinations","op":"equals","value":["after.svg","paragraph.svg","quote.svg","list.svg","context.md","real.svg"]}]},
  {"step_id":"indentation-real-images","entry_path":"prompts/cli/runtime-markdown.prompt.md","operation":"markdownLinks","input":{"text":{"$step_result":{"step_id":"indentation-boundaries","path":"/text"}},"definitions":{"$step_result":{"step_id":"indentation-definitions","path":"/definitions"}},"imagesOnly":true},"checks":[{"criterion_id":"AC1","target":"result","path":"/destinations","op":"equals","value":["after.svg","paragraph.svg","quote.svg","list.svg","real.svg"]}]},
