  {"step_id":"existing-code-masks","entry_path":"prompts/cli/runtime-markdown.prompt.md","operation":"markdownSectionText","input":{"text":"# Existing\n\n```md\n![fence](hidden-fence.svg)\n[hidden]: hidden.svg\n```\n\nLead `![span](hidden-span.svg)` and <!-- ![comment](hidden-comment.svg) --> ![real](<real image.svg> \"title\")\n\n~~~\n![tilde](hidden-tilde.svg)\n~~~\n\n<!--\n![block](hidden-block.svg)\n-->\n![reference][shown]\n[shown]: shown.svg\n"},"checks":[{"criterion_id":"AC4","target":"result","path":"/text","op":"equals","value":"# Existing\n\n     \n                          \n                    \n   \n\nLead                            and                                         ![real](<real image.svg> \"title\")\n\n   \n                          \n   \n\n    \n                          \n   \n![reference][shown]\n[shown]: shown.svg\n"}]},
  {"step_id":"existing-example-definitions","entry_path":"prompts/cli/runtime-markdown.prompt.md","operation":"markdownDefinitions","input":{"text":{"$step_result":{"step_id":"existing-code-masks","path":"/text"}}},"checks":[{"criterion_id":"AC4","target":"result","path":"/definitions","op":"equals","value":[{"label":"shown","destination":"shown.svg"}]}]},
  {"step_id":"existing-real-destinations","entry_path":"prompts/cli/runtime-markdown.prompt.md","operation":"markdownLinks","input":{"text":{"$step_result":{"step_id":"existing-code-masks","path":"/text"}},"definitions":{"$step_result":{"step_id":"existing-example-definitions","path":"/definitions"}}},"checks":[{"criterion_id":"AC4","target":"result","path":"/destinations","op":"equals","value":["real image.svg","shown.svg"]}]},
